      "classification": "update",
      "source": "public/assets/images/OPPO_ColorOS_八月系统升级一览_(2026)/0.webp",
      "sourceIndex": 8,
      "sourceHash": "302f28157e6cc5cf166546445da72c20664c1ffd38f4e7fc62199419dfcef840",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-update-03"
      ],
      "text": "OPPO AI 优化 小布记忆自动收藏功能，支持同步 OPPO 浏览器、UC 浏览器、夸克、今日头条极速版等应用中收藏的内容。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-03"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-04",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "public/assets/images/OPPO_ColorOS_八月系统升级一览_(2026)/0.webp",
      "sourceIndex": 9,
      "sourceHash": "d9d8754263cb525c2eae3d7fff27cf5767bddc4fde2e13e222f27ec20a486c16",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-update-04"
      ],
      "text": "OPPO AI 优化 小布记忆记账洞见功能，点击我的账单左上角自动生成的消费偏好标签，可跳转查看相关账单明细。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-04"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-05",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "public/assets/images/OPPO_ColorOS_八月系统升级一览_(2026)/0.webp",
      "sourceIndex": 10,
      "sourceHash": "d794519ccb1462902911f44975a1a5fbc39ea5035a463b85295ffdd7e892a9e1",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-update-05"
      ],
      "text": "OPPO AI 优化 小布记忆旅行合集地图功能，支持滑动查看单天行程时，展示当天的路线地图及各地点之间的驾车耗时。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-05"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-06",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "public/assets/images/OPPO_ColorOS_八月系统升级一览_(2026)/0.webp",
      "sourceIndex": 11,
      "sourceHash": "e1df0bb8acf973a8dfd4bd4e3ee19ca34fa7f3f034e539d78a4f513280e4a770",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-update-06"
      ],
      "text": "安全隐私 新增 在“全部应用行为记录”中体现隐私替身防护状态，应用使用隐私替身后会在右上角增加隐私替身角标。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-06"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-07",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "public/assets/images/OPPO_ColorOS_八月系统升级一览_(2026)/0.webp",
      "sourceIndex": 12,
      "sourceHash": "5c5cce2e42547db45f2190026a4b74d3d5367fc9b843d10bca57b003e6459fb1",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-update-07"
      ],
      "text": "安全隐私 优化 手机管家、平板管家支持自定义首页常用工具，按需调整功能展示。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-07"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-08",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "public/assets/images/OPPO_ColorOS_八月系统升级一览_(2026)/0.webp",
      "sourceIndex": 13,
      "sourceHash": "a238db28abd4f038f64d23185c8d7340681e806ed0da32dab227b69934893c39",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-update-08"
      ],
      "text": "安全隐私 优化 隐藏应用的使用体验，在使用应用时可从屏幕底部上滑至右上角浮窗区，切换为浮窗显示。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-08"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-09",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "public/assets/images/OPPO_ColorOS_八月系统升级一览_(2026)/0.webp",
      "sourceIndex": 14,
      "sourceHash": "534cdd9ebda6e1a32002c203f7f3d3259bae2034a25c59867c1e9e64f2d013e4",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-update-09"
      ],
      "text": "安全隐私 优化 手机管家、平板管家风险应用权限管控范围，支持管控更多应用权限（如无障碍服务、所有文件访问权限）。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-09"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-10",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "public/assets/images/OPPO_ColorOS_八月系统升级一览_(2026)/0.webp",
      "sourceIndex": 15,
      "sourceHash": "a465950e1af65945c8b47f0b51e74eb303705c9e2f7e4b887f71d3f4512752c0",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-update-10"
      ],
      "text": "安全隐私 优化 手机管家、平板管家“病毒风险”功能，扫描发现风险应用后，自动将该应用的重要权限全部设置为“不允许”，并开启隐私替身替换敏感数据。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-11",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "public/assets/images/OPPO_ColorOS_八月系统升级一览_(2026)/0.webp",
      "sourceIndex": 16,
      "sourceHash": "4225f664e34813bd5f41fe2f4fff03e9227a5d217e15fca044d1bfb54dd52eaa",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-update-11"
      ],
      "text": "安全隐私 优化 手机管家、平板管家清理存储页面，分区展示使用更方便。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-12",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "public/assets/images/OPPO_ColorOS_八月系统升级一览_(2026)/0.webp",
      "sourceIndex": 17,
      "sourceHash": "19acd58d9e79a8c92215627ef0bb428161d7381071877353c6c157f9bee060ac",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-update-12"
      ],
      "text": "便签 新增 支持在便签中点击查看图片时可直接进行涂鸦二次编辑。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-13",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "public/assets/images/OPPO_ColorOS_八月系统升级一览_(2026)/0.webp",
      "sourceIndex": 18,
      "sourceHash": "71bae972688b7f2357b5fc6bd99b4f6cc2d5ada79db426b4068f88b96ac88c3c",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-update-13"
      ],
      "text": "天气 新增 支持在桌面添加“台风路径”卡片，可实时展示台风路径、风力、强度等信息。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-14",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "public/assets/images/OPPO_ColorOS_八月系统升级一览_(2026)/0.webp",
      "sourceIndex": 19,
      "sourceHash": "dd7c65dcfca57b07b6d8bced5ebf76ba3fbdb3ee91d8fec134270b44c0585fea",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-update-14"
      ],
      "text": "设备互联 新增 跨屏解锁功能，平板与手机连接后开启手机投屏，可在平板上的手机镜像界面直接解锁手机。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-15",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "public/assets/images/OPPO_ColorOS_八月系统升级一览_(2026)/0.webp",
      "sourceIndex": 20,
      "sourceHash": "56fb1647a8f5b55c2141e6d903385717ee0d52e2a2b5186d0998af5c904d92d0",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-update-15"
      ],
      "text": "设备互联 优化 跨设备剪贴板同步功能，通过手机或平板的小布扫一扫提取文字、表格后，可一键无缝粘贴至互联的电脑、平板或手机中。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-15"
      ]
    }
